{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pulls/3","id":4808395899,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVDLuqM8AAAABHppMew","html_url":"https://github.com/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pull/3.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/issues/3","number":3,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add portable handoffs and verifiable cross-repository delivery","user":{"login":"AdolphKevin","id":27267992,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjY3OTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27267992?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin","html_url":"https://github.com/AdolphKevin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n跨工具接手时，旧流程缺少可追溯的共享进度，也无法将持续集成结果对应到实际代码和验收范围。此变更新增基于 GitHub Issues 的接续与交接、GitHub Actions 结果导入及跨仓版本核查；项目知识继续只通过独立 CS 读取，MATT 方法按需直接复用。\n\n```text\nGitHub Issue → resume / handoff → 可接续状态与缺口\n原始运行 + 版本 + 检查定义 → import-result → verify / aggregate\nCS → 登记原文、同任务结果与独立经验\n```\n\n第二版配置与材料继续按原范围读取，新协作和可移植结果采用第三版。负责人变化不重置需求；正文、代码或检查变化会使不适用的交接、审查或结果失效。工具只生成平台更新草稿，不建立后台同步或逐仓脚本。\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** 0.3 仅有本机交付材料，无法识别并行交接、外部结果运行批次及遗漏公共依赖。\n  **After:** 74 项行为回归通过，覆盖旧批次、错误版本、缺失/跳过/零用例、历史冲突、公共依赖、需求正文变化和原始报告篡改；8 项真实 CS 接口检查通过。\n- 41 个 MATT 文件反向补丁核对、16 个技能格式检查通过；集中安装目录与两端通用包已验证。两种工具的双向合成任务均完成，并在共享版本上通过最终四层核查；实际包切换与联网限制在验收报告中保留。候选版已发布：[0.4.0-rc.1](https://github.com/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/releases/tag/v0.4.0-rc.1)，源码固定 fcf2c90，PR 后续仅补充试用文档。\n- 真实 Core gRPC、Gateway WebSocket 和 PostgreSQL 的四类联合场景已执行通过；原始业务证据保留在业务仓。业务未共享改动、真人双向协作和最终可移植联合交付仍是明确缺口。\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n保留第二版读取行为，不迁移项目知识，不自动切换在途任务版本。第三版平台审查需使用 `review-template --issue` 捕获需求版本。\n\n**Blast Radius:** workflow\n\n影响集中插件与验证工具；CS 2.1.0 固定依赖仍在独立草稿 PR。先发布候选版，正式版仍等待验收标准中剩余的真实成员与业务交付条件。\n","created_at":"2026-10-10T03:32:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T04:26:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-10T04:11:35Z","merged_at":"2026-10-10T04:11:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"bef26011044dc13c385811295ec3d52fdd340ffc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdolphKevin/team-workflow/statuses/3fb29b0669c4cf88c386c6a461a9202af7133619","head":{"label":"AdolphKevin:codex/team-workflow-v04","ref":"codex/team-workflow-v04","sha":"3fb29b0669c4cf88c386c6a461a9202af7133619","user":{"login":"AdolphKevin","id":27267992,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjY3OTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27267992?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin","html_url":"https://github.com/AdolphKevin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdolphKevin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adolph